[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2502202464","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99689#issuecomment-2502202464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99689","id":2502202464,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VJJRg","user":{"login":"peterdang1502","id":58862494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODYyNDk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58862494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502","html_url":"https://github.com/peterdang1502","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T23:48:39Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T23:50:27Z","body":"I can help look into this if anyone can give me a pointer to where the default project path gets set. After looking through the code in the debugger, I think it has something to do with this block of code on line 586 in the `editor_settings.cpp` file:\n\n```\n// Directories\nEDITOR_SETTING(Variant::STRING, PROPERTY_HINT_GLOBAL_DIR, \"filesystem/directories/autoscan_project_path\", \"\", \"\")\nconst String fs_dir_default_project_path = OS::get_singleton()->has_environment(\"HOME\") ? OS::get_singleton()->get_environment(\"HOME\") : OS::get_singleton()->get_system_dir(OS::SYSTEM_DIR_DOCUMENTS);\nEDITOR_SETTING_BASIC(Variant::STRING, PROPERTY_HINT_GLOBAL_DIR, \"filesystem/directories/default_project_path\", fs_dir_default_project_path, \"\")\n```\n\nBut when I change the default path, the variable `fs_dir_default_project_path` just points to my system's default path I think, so I'm unsure of where the default path is getting set after I change it in the editor.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2502202464/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2504791889","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99689#issuecomment-2504791889","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99689","id":2504791889,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VTBdR","user":{"login":"amarsero","id":18059974,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDU5OTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18059974?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero","html_url":"https://github.com/amarsero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-27T21:25:06Z","updated_at":"2024-11-27T21:25:06Z","body":"Hi @peterdang1502, i think what you are looking for is in [EditorSettings::_set#L64](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f128f383e892865379cb8b14e7bcc9858efe2973/editor/editor_settings.cpp#L64).\n\nI was thinking maybe it's better to just clean the path when reading the setting somewhere around [ProjectDialog::show_dialog#L760](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/project_manager/project_dialog.cpp#L760)?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2504791889/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2505032635","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99689#issuecomment-2505032635","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99689","id":2505032635,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VT8O7","user":{"login":"peterdang1502","id":58862494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODYyNDk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58862494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502","html_url":"https://github.com/peterdang1502","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterdang1502/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024